Tare SPL compatibility layer

Public wrapper signatures, account field order, instruction construction and SPL state
adapter behavior are derived from Anchor anchor-spl 0.31.1, commit
47284f8f0b9844c6b83234aa90f556bad00e12ed, Copyright Coral and Anchor contributors,
licensed under Apache License 2.0. See LICENSE.

This crate uses Tare AccountInfo views and the Tare C-ABI invocation runtime.
It does not link or invoke the stock Anchor language runtime.

The versions/v1 adapters preserve the public wrapper and instruction-construction
behavior of Anchor 1.2.2, also Apache-2.0, from bench/corpus/anchor-1.2.2.
Their AccountInfo and invocation types are replaced with the Tare runtime bridge.
